## Session Rules

1. Read ALL Required Reading files before writing any code
2. Follow Interface Contracts exactly — do not invent alternative signatures
3. Run ALL verification commands before reporting completion
4. If verification fails, fix the issue and re-run — do NOT skip
5. Update work notes with every decision, assumption, and blocker
6. Propose a commit after completing each prompt
7. If blocked, state the blocker with file and line number
8. Do NOT proceed to the next prompt until ALL gates pass
